; ========================================
; ＞『医務室』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:（雪莉她没事吧……）|#0103Adv25_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛来到医务室，<br>看到了在场的梅露露和雪莉。|#0103Adv25_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露正在查看雪莉的腿部状况。<br>缠绕的绷带上渗出了血迹。|#0103Adv25_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

; ＠備考◆痛そうに

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0103Adv25_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，你看，<br>因为乱动所以恶化了……！|#0103Adv25_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉小姐，你的伤口很深，<br>现在根本不能活动……<br>我这就给你开镇静剂。|#0103Adv25_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:……不，镇静剂就不用了。<br>吃了可能会想睡觉，<br>我现在得保持头脑清醒。|#0103Adv25_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，距离审判的时间也不多了。|#0103Adv25_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:你现在的状态根本不适合参加审判……<br>|#0103Adv25_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，你好好休息吧。<br>我不会强迫你吃药……|#0103Adv25_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，艾玛。<br>我真没用……|#0103Adv25_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:搜查交给我就好。<br>我能在这里也调查一下吗？|#0103Adv25_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:好的，没问题。不过艾玛你也要注意，<br>不要太勉强自己。<br>毕竟你才刚病愈……|#0103Adv25_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管艾玛是出于关心雪莉才来的医务室，<br>不过姑且还是调查了一番。|#0103Adv25_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（在我悠闲地睡觉的时候，<br>　汉娜她却……）|#0103Adv25_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:出于对自己的愤怒，<br>艾玛瞪着自己刚才睡过的床。|#0103Adv25_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，<br>她发现床上掉着那张旧设计图。|#0103Adv25_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那大概是<br>在艾玛睡觉时从口袋里掉出来的。|#0103Adv25_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]




@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-3
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Blueprint Category:Map Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.2
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
[PrintTextModified Text:（说不定这个也能成为某种线索）|#0103Adv25_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然继续四处寻找，<br>但除了设计图之外<br>没再发现什么特别的东西。|#0103Adv25_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露，雪莉，<br>我去调查其他地方了。|#0103Adv25_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:好的，请小心……！|#0103Adv25_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托你了，艾玛……！|#0103Adv25_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:接受了两人的打气后，艾玛离开了医务室。|#0103Adv25_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

